#. y1:english="Whoa, whoa!{PA:10}||What's the relationship between you two?\nHuh? {PA:20}What do you mean...?\nSo? {PA:10}Are you her father or something?\nYes,{PA:10} I am.\nOh, {PA:10}really?{PA:10}||Do you have any proof that you are?\nNo,{PA:10} I'm not.\nSo, you're following this little girl||even though you're not her father...?\n(Run...!)\nHey! {PA:20}What do you think you're doing?{PA:10}||You were trying to run, {PA:10}weren't you?\n......\nWhy did you try to run away?{PA:10}||Huh?\n.........\n...That's enough!\nHuh?\nOfficer!\nWhat?\nStop picking on my daddy!\nHuh?\nMy daddy is a scaredy cat,{PA:20}||so he gets confused easily.\nI feel sorry for my daddy.{PA:20}||So please stop picking on him!\nHuh?{PA:10}||So, he really is your father?\nYes!\nMan...{PA:20}\nYou must be proud to have||a daughter like her.\nYou should act a little more||responsible from now on.\nCan we go now?\nYeah, {PA:10}go ahead.\n...Yeah{PA:20} ...I do.\nNo, you don't!{PA:10}||Come with me to the station.\nNo, {PA:10}mister!{PA:10}\nThey'll send me back to||the orphanage for sure!\nWe'll discuss this at the station!{PA:10}||Come on,{PA:10} let's go!\n......\nNo, {PA:10}I don't...\nYou don't have any ID?{PA:10}\nSorry, but both of you,{PA:10}||please come down to the station with me.\nNo, {PA:10}mister!{PA:10}\nThey'll send me back to||the orphanage for sure!\nWe'll discuss this at the station!{PA:10}||Come on,{PA:10} let's go!\nYes,{PA:10} I am.\nYou are very honest.{PA:20}||That's a good thing.{PA:20}\nSorry, but both of you,||please come down to the station with me.\nNo,{PA:10} mister!{PA:10}\nThey'll send me back to||the orphanage for sure!\nWe'll discuss this at the station!{PA:10}||Come on, {PA:10}let's go!\nDon't lie to me!{PA:10}||I've been watching you!\nSorry, but both of you,||please come down to the station with me.\nNo,{PA:10} mister!{PA:10} They'll send me||back to the orphanage for sure!\nWe'll discuss this at the station!{PA:10}||Come on, {PA:10}let's go!\n......"
